- `previewCamera.position.set(c.x+8.5,7.8,c.z+11.5)`.
- Because preview camera layer set 1+2; lights layer 1 and 2.
- Need main render before preview; yes.

But note `renderer.render(scene, camera)` clears full canvas. Then preview render with autoClear clears the scissored region only. Good. After preview, next frame main render clears full canvas.

